OL,3,AThe Pitt is up for 25 Emmys - but the
OL,4,Ashow's biggest fans are real-life
OL,5,Adoctors
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt's a familiar sight: a crowded
OL,8,Fwaiting room, trolleys in corridors,
OL,9,Fstressed doctors and nurses. But this
OL,10,Fisn't a typical A&E unit in the NHS,
OL,11,Fit's a Hollywood set with actors
OL,12,Frecreating the drama of an emergency
OL,13,Fdepartment for TV series The Pitt.
OL,15,FAnd among its biggest fans are
OL,16,Freal-life doctors.
OL,18,F"We finally feel validated for
OL,19,Feverything we go through every day,"
OL,20,Fsays Dr Tony Cirillo, President of the
OL,21,FAmerican College of Emergency
OL,22,FPhysicians.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
