OL,3,AThe Pitt is up for 25 Emmys - but the
OL,4,Ashow's biggest fans are real-life
OL,5,Adoctors
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Monday, The Pitt could become this
OL,8,Fyear's most decorated series at the
OL,9,FEmmys, America's most coveted TV
OL,10,Fhonours, with 25 nominations.
